category: Libs
requires: cygwin libgfortran5 libyajl2
sdesc: "Modern Fortran interface to the YAJL library (runtime)"
ldesc: "The YAJL-Fort package provides a modern object-oriented Fortran interface to
the YAJL C library, which is an event-driven parser for JSON data streams.
JSON is an open standard data interchange format. It is lightweight, easy for
humans to read and write, and language independent."
external-source: yajl-fort

